  <note type="Be Prepared" number="7.1">
    <p>Before you get started, take this readiness quiz.</p>
    <p>Simplify: $$\frac{90y}{15y^{2}}.$$
If you missed this problem, review Example 5.13.</p>
  </note>
  <note type="Be Prepared" number="7.2">
    <p>Multiply: $$\frac{14}{15} \cdot \frac{6}{35}.$$
If you missed this problem, review Example 1.25.</p>
  </note>
  <note type="Be Prepared" number="7.3">
